 basketball team during the 1965-1966 season."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 517, "end": 676, "text": "This places him squarely within the NCAA Division I men's basketball league, which is the highest level of college basketball competition in the United States."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 677, "end": 788, "text": "\"We're proud to have had Randy Judd represent UCLA on the court,\" said UCLA Athletics Director, Martin Jarmond."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 789, "end": 913, "text": "\"Although his time with us was short, he was an integral part of our team and contributed to our rich basketball tradition.\""}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 914, "end": 1093, "text": "Data from the NCAA confirms that UCLA was a member of the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during the 1965-1966 season, further solidifying Judd's connection to the league."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1094, "end": 1278, "text": "\"Randy Judd's participation in NCAA Division I men's basketball is a testament to his hard work and dedication to the sport,\" said Dan Gavitt, NCAA Senior Vice President of Basketball."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1279, "end": 1347, "text": "\"We're honored to have had him as part of our basketball community.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1348, "end": 1461, "text": "While Judd's collegiate career was cut short, his legacy lives on as a part of UCLA's storied basketball history."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1462, "end": 1616, "text": "The Bruins have won a record 11 NCAA championships, and Judd's contributions, although brief, are still recognized as an important part of that tradition."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1617, "end": 1773, "text": "In conclusion, the evidence overwhelmingly supports the claim that 